/**
 * Structure-only event shapes of a REAL work session (exported 2026-11-10 from a
 * production W session log), for `locus_work_history` tests.
 *
 * What is kept: event types, `source.kind`, turn boundaries (`turn/start`,
 * `turn/end` + reason), assistant content block types and the `tool/call`
 * events between messages (a turn's final text is the last text-only assistant
 * message with no `tool/call` after it). EVERY text is a `<placeholder-N>`;
 * tool names, ids, usage, streams, finish reasons, timestamps, images, skill
 * catalogs and runtime context are dropped. Do not paste raw session text here: the repo keeps no raw history.
 *
 * Real shapes worth knowing (pitfalls section 4): `user/message` carries
 * `role/content/source` directly on `data`; `assistant/message` carries them
 * under `data.message`. Turns 1 and 7 start with a `plugin:dsh-memex` injection
 * BEFORE the human input; turns 9-12 are collaboration wake-ups
 * (`plugin:dsh-collab`); turn 3 was aborted; turn 5 has a mid-turn user steer.
 */
